{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A solo developer</strong> pays tribute to the dedication and sacrifice of real soldiers by creating an immersive game about a lone operative fighting against overwhelming odds. This project is a labor of passion, built to honor those who stand on the front lines and face the unthinkable so others don\u2019t have to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are Kellan Graves, a soldier of the Echo-6 unit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After falling deep into the planet Elior, you find yourself inside a vast network of caves filled with alien creatures and traces of the mysterious Synod.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed only with a pistol and a list of objectives, you must fight, complete missions, and uncover what the Synod has been hiding beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/8a7fcf76f6d3728a52d1b213cb563cb0.poster.avif?t=1768496301\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/8a7fcf76f6d3728a52d1b213cb563cb0.webm?t=1768496301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/8a7fcf76f6d3728a52d1b213cb563cb0.mp4?t=1768496301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the underground</strong> \u2013 claustrophobic tunnels, alien creatures, and signs of expeditions that never returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct contact with the Synod</strong> \u2013 the leader speaks to you through the radio, observes your progress, and puts you through trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist arsenal</strong> \u2013 one pistol and straightforward, grounded combat in Echo-6 style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story through exploration</strong> \u2013 notes, recordings, and traces left by scouts reveal the fate of Echo-4 and the Synod\u2019s actions on Elior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2\u20133 hours of varied gameplay</strong> \u2013 intense fights mixed with quieter moments of exploration and story discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/0f13a22a9b4f262f62a073c2be6599aa.poster.avif?t=1768496301\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/0f13a22a9b4f262f62a073c2be6599aa.webm?t=1768496301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/0f13a22a9b4f262f62a073c2be6599aa.mp4?t=1768496301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underground, in the dark, under the watch of the Synod.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the darkness, Kellan Graves is not entirely alone.<br>A small, living dog stays close \u2014 loyal, alert, and braver than his size suggests on an alien world.<br>He\u2019s no fighter, but a companion who reacts to every sound and brings warmth into places where silence becomes unbearable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they move through the caves, facing alien creatures and the trials the Synod places in their way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/6efe5eeab93328a81d29138ea017cf59.poster.avif?t=1768496301\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/6efe5eeab93328a81d29138ea017cf59.webm?t=1768496301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/6efe5eeab93328a81d29138ea017cf59.mp4?t=1768496301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1. The Fall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024070/1e568ac7ebd0cc35645ffbeb5924a928885c9484.jpg"},{"name":"2. Into the Dark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024070/6e5ee90d2ef57c4bf120a5ac3f3bedbb7bdc46b9.jpg"},{"name":"3. Echoes Left Behind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024070/14c6b6d1731852d7620f50eafc18a39752e8564a.jpg"},{"name":"4. Alone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024070/f7d754d810f15970e2cf2ec9a680d0ce9a768d57.jpg"},{"name":"5. Spider Night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024070/174581baf10146cb148203febe2e07ca31c3ed0d.jpg"},{"name":"6. Dead Station","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024070/0f8b03c5c5875c4a79ae52390202bb858622356d.jpg"},{"name":"7. Resonance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024070/8d92391abcfabdfbad9ba3833bf0132c297e6600.jpg"},{"name":"8. No Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024070/200561591ecd0a7263c17985bca1250a5c4f36d5.jpg"},{"name":"9. Not the First","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024070/d2bf0fc766f0eb9aab6f82deb9a5654e65b01dca.jpg"},{"name":"10. Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4024070/3efde0e8d694ec06f44e5fb5efeca0214bfb44a0.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024070?t=1768496301","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/71c801d5503bf4f26db868dd26b176561a21d6f6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768496301","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/e298d51e90a43e890060fcd33fa6b229395fbbc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768496301","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/e298d51e90a43e890060fcd33fa6b229395fbbc2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768496301","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A solo developer</strong> pays tribute to the dedication and sacrifice of real soldiers by creating an immersive game about a lone operative fighting against overwhelming odds. This project is a labor of passion, built to honor those who stand on the front lines and face the unthinkable so others don\u2019t have to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are Kellan Graves, a soldier of the Echo-6 unit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After falling deep into the planet Elior, you find yourself inside a vast network of caves filled with alien creatures and traces of the mysterious Synod.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed only with a pistol and a list of objectives, you must fight, complete missions, and uncover what the Synod has been hiding beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/8a7fcf76f6d3728a52d1b213cb563cb0.poster.avif?t=1768496301\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/8a7fcf76f6d3728a52d1b213cb563cb0.webm?t=1768496301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/8a7fcf76f6d3728a52d1b213cb563cb0.mp4?t=1768496301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the underground</strong> \u2013 claustrophobic tunnels, alien creatures, and signs of expeditions that never returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct contact with the Synod</strong> \u2013 the leader speaks to you through the radio, observes your progress, and puts you through trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist arsenal</strong> \u2013 one pistol and straightforward, grounded combat in Echo-6 style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story through exploration</strong> \u2013 notes, recordings, and traces left by scouts reveal the fate of Echo-4 and the Synod\u2019s actions on Elior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2\u20133 hours of varied gameplay</strong> \u2013 intense fights mixed with quieter moments of exploration and story discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/0f13a22a9b4f262f62a073c2be6599aa.poster.avif?t=1768496301\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/0f13a22a9b4f262f62a073c2be6599aa.webm?t=1768496301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/0f13a22a9b4f262f62a073c2be6599aa.mp4?t=1768496301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underground, in the dark, under the watch of the Synod.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the darkness, Kellan Graves is not entirely alone.<br>A small, living dog stays close \u2014 loyal, alert, and braver than his size suggests on an alien world.<br>He\u2019s no fighter, but a companion who reacts to every sound and brings warmth into places where silence becomes unbearable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they move through the caves, facing alien creatures and the trials the Synod places in their way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/6efe5eeab93328a81d29138ea017cf59.poster.avif?t=1768496301\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/6efe5eeab93328a81d29138ea017cf59.webm?t=1768496301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/extras/6efe5eeab93328a81d29138ea017cf59.mp4?t=1768496301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Tomasz Linke"],"dlc":[4049980],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024070/87bb13abf1a8d5924eb64284e87235f66855ab0d/header.jpg?t=1768496301","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4024070/1611612281/1119bdd1dbc5b3f5665685626b94d328db0e0367/1764705083/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764705402","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4024070/1611612281/1119bdd1dbc5b3f5665685626b94d328db0e0367/1764705083/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764705402","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4024070/1611612281/1119bdd1dbc5b3f5665685626b94d328db0e0367/1764705083/hls_264_master.m3u